// be-music course checklist fixture skin (LR2): the select screen.
// It only has to exercise behaviour: the bar list, the PLAY / AUTO buttons (15 / 16), the course maker's
// finish / cancel buttons (230 / 231) and the course texts behind op 290. parts.png is four bands of colour,
// 64 pixels each: grey, blue, orange, green (written by scripts/course-checklist/fixtures.ts).
#INFORMATION,5,BE-MUSIC E2E,be-music,
#ENDOFHEADER
#STARTINPUT,0
#IMAGE,LR2files\Theme\E2E\parts.png
#FONT,16,1,0,sans-serif
#FONT,12,1,0,sans-serif

// Background.
